Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Auntie Stella and\Nthe construction guys are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.93,0:00:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, looks like the guild made\Nit through without much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I've\Ntaken a good look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.53,0:00:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't learn one decent skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.77,0:00:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You spent a full three-month term\Npracticing at every training school,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you didn't pass one? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.11,0:00:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.99,0:01:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, I'm sorry. I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.95,0:01:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't let you\Nregister as an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was really fun to be reunited with my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.95,0:01:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instructors from back in\Nmy first training days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.03,0:01:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.75,0:01:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last time I saw them\Nwas like 15 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a red light, I'm a red light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a red light, I'm a red light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're a red light,\NI'll take the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.85,0:01:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not given any way to the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.11,0:01:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:02:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.67,0:02:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to return,\Neven if you don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.71,0:02:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.51,0:02:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.07,0:02:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.45,0:02:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.10,0:02:52.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Clays Royal Capital - 15 Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.49,0:02:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to train as a swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Train with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you happen to have a permit\Nfrom the Adventurer's Guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got one from the Guildmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.47,0:03:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The training is intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to\Nfinish no matter how hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.39,0:03:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will be even more intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will be lucky to last three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is day 10 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, the kid has a tenacity\Nthat is definitely nothing to scar?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.61,0:03:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not drop your sword no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.27,0:04:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy will not wait for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hard to believe his eyes\Nare still so full of vigor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even after being put\Nthrough such a brutal test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, the kid might actually\Nhave a promising future.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When do you think I'll be able\Nto start learning a real skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:29.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not something I decide for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then can you at least show me what\Nkind of skill I might be able to learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How was that, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I couldn't see most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.55,0:04:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that would figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is a swift foot technique that\Nis even difficult for me to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A boy like this probably\Ncouldn't see much of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You kept the same rhythm the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were steady like a clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I caught that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.73,0:05:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such latent potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.83,0:05:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If nurtured properly, he could match me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or surpass me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.73,0:05:32.23,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(83.2,97.2)}2 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.73,0:05:32.23,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(76.8,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.95,0:05:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why has he not been able to\Nlearn a skill aside from parry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:41.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he needs is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one skill that could\Nbe considered useful.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.98,0:05:47.56,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(83.2,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.98,0:05:47.56,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(76.8,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Noor.\NUh-huh. Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, just give me a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:51.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.42,0:05:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going further would\Nonly be a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A parry isn't enough for someone\Nto make it as a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.03,0:06:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swordsmanship is something he simply\Ndoesn't have the aptitude for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps it would be wiser if you\Nwere to choose another path who knows
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:13.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your talent may be found in another\Ncapacity there must be another
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,path for this child whoa whoa really
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're serious about taking part
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.91,0:06:24.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in my training camp the swordsman\Ninstructor told me to try something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,else sig sent you huh i had heard\Nhe was looking after a little kid
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but uh he looks small enough to get\Nblown away by a light breeze. I would
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:37.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have been adventurer no matter what\Na warrior's role is to become the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shield for their allies you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that mm-hmm okay then let's do it
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.02,0:06:49.35,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(76.8,216.0)}2 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.02,0:06:49.35,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(70.4,241.2)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'll give the boy credit i\Nnever thought he'd get this far
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.85,0:07:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, talk about being tough and\Ngutsy if he could just acquire a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,skill i could train this kid to be
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,invincible i'm sorry noor i can keep
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.40,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(454.4,216.0)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.40,0:07:24.40,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(448.0,241.2)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going, I acknowledge your efforts.\NBut what you have acquired is only a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slight improvement of your natural\Nabilities force yourself to continue
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may very well lose your life\Nsorry but you'll have to move on he
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,toughed it out more than most he\Ndeserves to be where his efforts are
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rewarded please allow me to train\Nhere you really want to do this kid
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i do well if you insist okay here\Nhit that stick hanging over there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.97,0:08:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's kind of far away\Nyeah yeah just do it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and once he misses i can\Ntell him to get lost i
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can already tell he's\Ngonna be a huge pain in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the um was that one good\Nenough okay do it again
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there good no no no no i want\Nnothing to do with this little twerp
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor, why am I doing nothing\Nbut throwing rocks at stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I just know you're going\Nto be too much trouble, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to use a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, get a good grip on\Nit and stand in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A good grip, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trouble, trouble, trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, kid? That was the last\Nof my training bows. Don't break mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.75,0:09:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my bow can handle even the strongest
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just stick to throwing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.85,0:09:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stones got it okay
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.23,0:09:12.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(70.4,216.0)}2 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.23,0:09:12.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(64.0,241.2)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who taught you to throw like that\Nnobody taught me this is just how i've
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always hunted birds The super colorful\Nones that swoop down and grab rabbits
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding\Nme—that's a thunder flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.35,0:09:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's difficult for even the most seasoned
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hunter to bring those\Nthings down Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could totally do it with my eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.53,0:09:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in him being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think I've seen enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(76.8,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(70.4,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I haven't learned anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, you lack the prudence to\Nhandle any sort of delicate weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.47,0:09:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good with rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.57,0:10:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't need a bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.31,0:10:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be a waste of everyone's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be the kid\NI've been hearing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not? Huh? You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.41,0:10:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will start right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.97,0:10:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sense the enemy's presence and sneak up on\Nthem without making a sound in your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.05,0:10:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.37,0:10:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will have to do better than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are various traps\Nrigged along the corridor.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.10,0:10:45.15,Song,,0,0,0,,{\an8\an8\blur0.5\fs17}There are various traps\Nrigged along this corridor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avoid setting off any of the traps and\Nmake your way to this treasure chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avoid all the traps, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.45,0:11:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.93,0:11:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although he...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he is missing the point of the exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You failed to dismantle the traps, and\Nyour situational awareness is abysmal.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.98,0:11:20.65,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(441.6,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:11:17.98,0:11:20.65,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(435.2,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.11,0:11:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no hope of becoming a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.81,0:11:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, this boy has tenacity\Nthat is beyond comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A valuable quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he ever gives up on\Nbecoming an adventurer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.47,0:11:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will extend an invitation to\Njoin the Royal Intelligence Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.49,0:11:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quite young to be\Napplying for this, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure there's an age\Nrequirement of at least 15 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.51,0:11:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already got a permit\Nfrom the Guildmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've trained at a bunch\Nof the other schools, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't work out.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.65,0:12:01.35,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(454.4,129.6)}2 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.65,0:12:01.35,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(448.0,154.8)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.67,0:12:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems the reason you\Nstruggle to use magic is because
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no mono flowing\Nthrough you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it not flow through me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps you were just born that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case then,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only hope of changing that is to\Ngo inside the mono resonance room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rizzo... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.69,0:12:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.15,0:12:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But leave immediately if it starts\Nfeeling too intense for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A boy hasn't come outside yet? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, that is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.03,0:12:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That room drastically amplifies all of the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.25,0:12:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,human senses and he's\Nbeen in there for days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could kill him if we're not careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.59,0:12:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.69,0:12:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.03,0:12:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does your body feel all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.81,0:12:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little longer, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm about to have a breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.33,0:13:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all I've learned to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(441.6,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.77,0:13:11.52,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(435.2,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think you've come this far, yet\Nall you can manage is tiny flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.47,0:13:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's extremely rare to see someone as\Nincapable of magic as you seem to be, Gnor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look, given your lack of mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.25,0:13:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's actually impressive\Nhow far you've come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.63,0:13:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I seeing this right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he dual casting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took me 50 years to get to that point,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.41,0:13:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yet he managed it on his\Nown in just three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.31,0:13:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't help me be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.37,0:13:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out this isn't the right\Nplace for you either, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kid has so much talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:13:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only his body were\Nmore attuned to magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could have been known throughout\Nthe land as an unparalleled magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, let me ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you undergo the rite of blessing\Nwhen you were a small child?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.35,0:14:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rite of blessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this school,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.67,0:14:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only those who were selected in advance\Nand underwent the ceremony can train.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.53,0:14:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.05,0:14:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving until you\Nagree to let me train.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving until you\Nagree to let me train with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cannot seriously intend\Nto stay there forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.35,0:15:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will allow you to participate\Nin the basics of our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although please,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understand that there is no guarantee\Nyou will actually acquire a skill.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.60,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(441.6,97.2)}3 Months After
Dialogue: 1,0:15:42.02,0:15:43.60,Garamond,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(435.2,122.4)}Training Started
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is most certainly low heal, but\Nhow on earth is this even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.43,0:15:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, unfortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:15:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,low heal won't be\Nrecognized as a serviceable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.01,0:16:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,skill to make you an\Naccredited adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.51,0:16:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have known.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.65,0:16:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it only works on scratches,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's still impressive you\Ncan use low-level healing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,magic without a natural blessing\Nalready bestowed on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.63,0:16:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He performed a miracle all on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.33,0:16:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without undergoing the rite or\Nusing a spirit as an intermediary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which, in a manner of speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,means he can wield the power\Nof miracles without limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.63,0:16:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Sane, about Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.85,0:16:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's disappeared from the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have stopped him\Nwhile I still had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can just leave him be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's strong enough\Nto hack it all on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.77,0:16:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we help in nurturing his gifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then he will undoubtedly become\Nsomeone quite extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.98,0:16:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.61,0:17:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea he was going through the\Nsame thing at all the other schools, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should all give him guidance\Nand the training that he deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.23,0:17:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That young man is overflowing\Nwith such promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no objection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although it means I cannot recruit\Nhim to the intelligence agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.63,0:17:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am of the same opinion as Saiyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.23,0:17:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, of course you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.05,0:17:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, Sig?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.21,0:17:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading off on a search\Nto find him now. Hey? Whoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I understand your\Neagerness but please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.45,0:17:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now just to be clear as the sovereign\Nsix we will all raise the boy as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all agree? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.41,0:17:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then let's go find this\Nyoung prodigy right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:17:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, looky here? Nor?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.49,0:17:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made it somehow found this\Nlying on the ground. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.81,0:18:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have flown off in the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.41,0:18:09.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suppose you're well on your way to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then you saw what was\Nhappening and came back. Sorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,news and turned around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all caked in mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.11,0:18:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your clothes are burnt up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a hectic
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.21,0:18:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.12,0:18:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of got into some stuff. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.37,0:18:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a pretty bad time too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.87,0:18:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here is in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I am worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.57,0:18:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to do this to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially since you're all beat to hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the foreman was looking\Nall over the place for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.97,0:18:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs you to haul away some rubble\Nand help build some temporary housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.49,0:18:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I came by, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.57,0:18:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you a map. One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having you back is a huge help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're here, our\Nprogress is off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.49,0:19:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I can still be of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whew, man, what a crazy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I went on a ride in a\Ncarriage, met a demon folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to fly with Lin's amazing magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.05,0:19:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I got to fly\Nagain by Lin's magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And some other stuff\Nhappened, but flying around
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.85,0:19:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all over the place is\Nwhat I remember most.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need something\Nto eat and get some rest
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soon but no time for that\Nyet there's work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you already figured it\Nout but the theocracy of Mithra.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.11,0:19:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were the ones working behind the scenes\Nwith Doritas on waging this war. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.29,0:20:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the Minotaur incident to the Empire's\Nweaponry, the high-purity monostones,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which can only be produced in Mithra,\Nhave been a factor at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear our future will not be peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.61,0:20:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, there are people\Nour nation can depend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.49,0:20:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.43,0:20:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we are blessed to have a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.07,0:20:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for\Neverything you did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real hero, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.01,0:21:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it was hard for you, but you're\Nstill here, handing out supplies. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've also been treating those\Nwho are injured as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.81,0:21:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're helping with the restoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you are in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm handing these out to\Neverybody, so please help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I really? By all means.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.13,0:21:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I better get back to it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.07,0:21:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So goodbye for now. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.29,0:21:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.20,0:21:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, Lin. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.53,0:21:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't work yourself too hard, instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I wouldn't be where I am\Nwithout so many people's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.25,0:21:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can move so much better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really is a good, sturdy sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.03,0:21:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shame it won't see very much\Nflashy action with me holding on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe one day, I'll finally\Nget to be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.33,0:22:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can have epic journeys\Nlike the heroes in the storybooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.33,0:22:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones like Dad read to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.61,0:22:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for the time being, I'll\Nput you to good use here. Nord!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.47,0:22:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've cleared out enough in this area!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you good to keep working elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.69,0:22:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.35,0:22:33.35,Freehand 471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs37}#12 I Parry Everything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.71,0:22:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess this is where\Nwe really belong anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.71,0:23:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.79,0:23:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.71,0:23:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, I love you. Give me.

